content.text:
Add scroll behavior in navigate for hash. Currently `navigate` only focus. Add:
```
if (options?.hash) {
  window.setTimeout(() => document.querySelector(options.hash)?.scrollIntoView({block:"start"}), 0);
  document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(options.hash)?.focus? no tabIndex.
}
```
Need `setTimeout` available in browser; yes. Use `window.setTimeout`. Could also focus the target if it's the document div? It doesn't have tabIndex. We can just scroll. Add.

